00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:05.473
So, set your goals.

00:02:08.563 --> 00:02:10.696
Number two is create a better environment,

00:02:10.696 --> 00:02:13.276
and this one is so, so, so, so important.

00:02:13.276 --> 00:02:15.629
Create a better environment.

00:02:15.629 --> 00:02:18.984
Chances are the reasons why you
didn't accomplish your goals

00:02:18.984 --> 00:02:21.712
