00:02:27.974 --> 00:02:30.163
Your friends, your family,
your habits, your routine,

00:02:30.163 --> 00:02:32.532
all of that stuff keeps you where you are.

00:02:32.532 --> 00:02:34.629
And so, when you think of that bold goal

00:02:34.629 --> 00:02:37.231
that you want to go out
and reach for next year

00:02:37.231 --> 00:02:39.063
think about what kind of environment

00:02:39.063 --> 00:02:40.852
