your office, in your home?

00:02:47.288 --> 00:02:48.121
What's on the wall?

00:02:48.121 --> 00:02:49.556
What music are you listening to?

00:02:49.556 --> 00:02:50.597
What videos are you watching?

00:02:50.597 --> 00:02:51.980
What books are you reading?

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:53.622
You need to create an environment

00:02:53.622 --> 00:02:56.244
that sets you up for success daily.

00:02:56.244 --> 00:02:57.738
Every single day.

00:02:57.738 --> 00:02:58.673
I don't know about you guys,

00:02:58.673 --> 00:03:01.301
but for me I can be so fired up.

00:03:01.301 --> 00:03:02.435
I'm fired up today.

00:03:02.435 --> 00:03:05.012
