00:03:13.909 --> 00:03:14.992
I'll wake up.

00:03:16.242 --> 00:03:18.721
Oh, okay, what do I do?

00:03:18.721 --> 00:03:19.832
And I have my schedule,

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:23.644
but what I do in my routines every day

00:03:23.644 --> 00:03:27.280
gets me back up to a
high as soon as possible.

00:03:27.280 --> 00:03:29.276
So, I wake up, I go to the bathroom,

00:03:29.276 --> 00:03:31.059
