00:03:31.059 --> 00:03:33.021
music to change my
state, to get me pumping,

00:03:33.021 --> 00:03:35.732
to get me moving, to get me
feeling a little bit of action.

00:03:35.732 --> 00:03:38.280
Then, I'll go work out and
I'll be watching videos.

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:40.347
I'll watch the videos to feed my brain,

00:03:40.347 --> 00:03:42.710
to not just give me the knowledge,

00:03:42.710 --> 00:03:45.222
but also give me the
motivation, the inspiration.

00:03:45.222 --> 00:03:48.553
Seeing somebody hit it hard
makes me want to hit it harder.

00:03:48.553 --> 00:03:49.744
Hit it harder in the workout,

00:03:49.744 --> 00:03:51.563
and then hit it harder when I finish,

00:03:51.563 --> 00:03:53.354
and start doing my work for the day.

00:03:53.354 --> 00:03:56.716
And so it's so, so, so,
so, so, so, so important

00:03:56.716 --> 00:03:59.398
that when you set that
big goal for yourself

00:03:59.398 --> 00:04:00.817
