00:04:15.417 --> 00:04:16.914
Try things right now.

00:04:16.914 --> 00:04:18.256
Don't wait 'til 2017.

00:04:18.256 --> 00:04:21.276
Try things right now and
see do I get that feeling.

00:04:21.276 --> 00:04:23.976
Think about when you've been
most motivated in your life.

00:04:23.976 --> 00:04:24.964
What happened?

00:04:24.964 --> 00:04:26.024
Were you at a seminar?

00:04:26.024 --> 00:04:27.209
Were you watching a video?

00:04:27.209 --> 00:04:28.963
Was there a song playing?

00:04:28.963 --> 00:04:33.170
When do you get pumped up and
inspired and feel unstoppable?

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:36.098
What happened just before
you felt unstoppable?

00:04:36.098 --> 00:04:37.516
What was the stimulus?

00:04:37.516 --> 00:04:40.292
And then instead of randomly
waiting for that to happen,

00:04:40.292 --> 00:04:43.705
inject that with intention
every day into your life.

00:04:43.705 --> 00:04:45.129
So, whatever that is

00:04:45.129 --> 00:04:47.405
do it as one of the first
things you do every single day

00:04:47.405 --> 00:04:48.690
so you get hit like,

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:51.075
I'm going to go do this today
and I believe in myself.

00:04:51.075 --> 00:04:52.859
I'm going to go attack that big goal.

00:04:52.859 --> 00:04:54.774
