environment to support you,

00:04:57.114 --> 00:04:58.872
goals never going to happen.

00:04:58.872 --> 00:05:01.455
So, create a great environment.

00:05:03.429 --> 00:05:05.740
Number three is say yes
to the uncomfortable.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:08.398
I want you to get used
to being uncomfortable.

00:05:08.398 --> 00:05:10.231
