One, two, three.

00:05:42.651 --> 00:05:45.307
Get used to doing things
that make you uncomfortable.

00:05:45.307 --> 00:05:47.936
Yeah, maybe there's people
behind me watching, right?

00:05:47.936 --> 00:05:50.564
But I wear different color socks a lot.

00:05:50.564 --> 00:05:51.698
