and strength and courage

00:06:32.551 --> 00:06:35.509
to go after, push more, and
push more, and push more.

00:06:35.509 --> 00:06:39.667
Get used to doing things that
make you feel uncomfortable,

00:06:39.667 --> 00:06:41.312
and whenever you get an idea,

00:06:41.312 --> 00:06:43.049
this is important you start right now.

00:06:43.049 --> 00:06:44.132
Start right now.

00:06:44.132 --> 00:06:47.282
Whenever you get an idea of
something that you feel like

00:06:47.282 --> 00:06:49.958
