00:07:22.982 --> 00:07:26.470
Alright, the number four step
that you can take right now

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:28.326
to start getting wealthy in 2017

00:07:28.326 --> 00:07:30.488
is build in some accountability.

00:07:30.488 --> 00:07:32.331
When you are accountable to somebody else

00:07:32.331 --> 00:07:34.352
you're much more likely to follow through.

00:07:34.352 --> 00:07:36.494
I would try to find somebody
that you can connect with,

00:07:36.494 --> 00:07:38.607
whether it's one friend,
whether it's a mastermind group,

00:07:38.607 --> 00:07:39.988
whether it's an online group,

00:07:39.988 --> 00:07:41.691
