00:07:41.691 --> 00:07:43.999
to your Facebook friends,
or YouTube channel,

00:07:43.999 --> 00:07:45.164
or whatever it is.

00:07:45.164 --> 00:07:47.998
Build in accountability
so that something happens

00:07:47.998 --> 00:07:49.351
if you don't follow through.

00:07:49.351 --> 00:07:52.228
If you say you're going to
do this and then you don't,

00:07:52.228 --> 00:07:54.042
