00:07:54.042 --> 00:07:54.875
who cares?

00:07:56.054 --> 00:07:57.218
Right?

00:07:57.218 --> 00:07:58.743
You're used to letting yourself down.

00:07:58.743 --> 00:08:00.671
You let yourself down all the time,

00:08:00.671 --> 00:08:02.708
and it's really hard to
hold yourself accountable.

00:08:02.708 --> 00:08:04.922
The best entrepreneurs
do that to themselves.

00:08:04.922 --> 00:08:07.747
They have so high standards

00:08:07.747 --> 00:08:10.546
