00:08:30.724 --> 00:08:33.130
Apply that to the rest of your goals.

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:36.332
Have a buddy, an entrepreneur
buddy or somebody else.

00:08:36.332 --> 00:08:37.754
One of your friends are
trying to accomplish something

00:08:37.754 --> 00:08:38.587
