00:08:38.587 --> 00:08:39.420
Great.

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:41.393
Connect weekly and push each other,

00:08:41.393 --> 00:08:43.212
because when you commit to somebody else

00:08:43.212 --> 00:08:45.038
you're much more likely to follow through,

00:08:45.038 --> 00:08:46.843
and I want you to follow
through on your goals.

00:08:46.843 --> 00:08:48.652
I want you to stop letting yourself down.

00:08:48.652 --> 00:08:50.354
I want this year, when you set that goal,

00:08:50.354 --> 00:08:52.686
