00:10:26.898 --> 00:10:28.618
I'm prolific in my creation.

00:10:28.618 --> 00:10:30.417
If you look at the people
who are the greatest

00:10:30.417 --> 00:10:32.597
at what they do, they practice.

00:10:32.597 --> 00:10:33.635
They work.

00:10:33.635 --> 00:10:34.990
They create.

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:37.227
So, yes, you may need to consume, right?

00:10:37.227 --> 00:10:39.759
At the start of my day, I'm a consumer

00:10:39.759 --> 00:10:41.210
at the start of every single day.

00:10:41.210 --> 00:10:43.481
I'm watching videos,
I'm listening to music.

00:10:43.481 --> 00:10:46.899
I'm consuming that stuff
to get my mindset right

00:10:46.899 --> 00:10:48.619
so that I can create.

00:10:48.619 --> 00:10:50.107
I made video not that long ago

00:10:50.107 --> 00:10:53.160
about how I don't want you to
watch every one of my videos.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:56.221
I don't want you to
watch every single video.

00:10:56.221 --> 00:10:59.090
I want you to watch the video
that applies most to you,

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.634
that the title sounds interesting,

00:11:00.634 --> 00:11:02.088
the thumbnail brought you in,

00:11:02.088 --> 00:11:04.902
and then use the knowledge
and apply it to your business.

00:11:04.902 --> 00:11:06.238
Take some action.

00:11:06.238 --> 00:11:07.870
I want you to take action.

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:10.221
I'd much rather have you
watch one video a month

00:11:10.221 --> 00:11:12.551
that speaks to you and then
you go out and do something

00:11:12.551 --> 00:11:14.745
than just consume.

00:11:14.745 --> 00:11:16.778
That's YouTube's goal is
they want you on YouTube

00:11:16.778 --> 00:11:18.909
as long as possible.

00:11:18.909 --> 00:11:20.719
If you could spend 24
hours a day on YouTube,

00:11:20.719 --> 00:11:22.216
YouTube would be so happy.

00:11:22.216 --> 00:11:23.367
That's not my goal.

00:11:23.367 --> 00:11:24.974
I want you out making something.

00:11:24.974 --> 00:11:26.929
And so, it's so easy to consume.

00:11:26.929 --> 00:11:28.203
Yes, you need to read books.

00:11:28.203 --> 00:11:29.625
Yes, you need to watch videos.

00:11:29.625 --> 00:11:30.755
Yes, you need to listen to music.

00:11:30.755 --> 00:11:32.194
Yes, you need to have conversations.

00:11:32.194 --> 00:11:34.327
Yes, you need to go to
seminars and conferences.

00:11:34.327 --> 00:11:35.869
Whatever it is, however you get off,

00:11:35.869 --> 00:11:38.267
however you consume information,

00:11:38.267 --> 00:11:42.350
you need to consume, but
you need to create more.

00:11:43.300 --> 00:11:45.275
And the most successful
people are the ones

00:11:45.275 --> 00:11:49.442
who start to tip that scale
from consuming so much

00:11:50.473 --> 00:11:52.206
and creating a little bit

00:11:52.206 --> 00:11:55.503
to consuming a little
bit and creating a lot.

00:11:55.503 --> 00:11:57.563
So, I want you to start now.

00:11:57.563 --> 00:12:00.333
Get into the habit of creating,

00:12:00.333 --> 00:12:02.622
because through the process of creating

00:12:02.622 --> 00:12:04.534
you'll discover what
you're really good at.

00:12:04.534 --> 00:12:06.480
You'll discover what you could
be the best in the world at.

00:12:06.480 --> 00:12:10.110
You'll discover how to bring
your artistic talent through

00:12:10.110 --> 00:12:12.153
into creating something
massively valuable.

00:12:12.153 --> 00:12:13.693
You'll discover how to test

00:12:13.693 --> 00:12:14.963
a whole bunch of different things

00:12:14.963 --> 00:12:17.221
and see which is the one
that you want to stick with.

00:12:17.221 --> 00:12:18.752
Instead of trying one thing out

00:12:18.752 --> 00:12:20.233
you're trying a hundred different things.

00:12:20.233 --> 00:12:22.363
You have the time to reallocate to do it.

00:12:22.363 --> 00:12:23.940
You're testing out what
works with customers.

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:25.644
You're getting feedback from them.

00:12:25.644 --> 00:12:29.092
You're building confidence in yourself.

00:12:29.092 --> 00:12:31.963
I can yell at a camera because
I've done 4,000 videos.

00:12:31.963 --> 00:12:33.555
Watch my first ones and I sucked,

00:12:33.555 --> 00:12:35.972
and I was nervous and scared.

00:12:36.891 --> 00:12:38.893
Still the same content,

00:12:38.893 --> 00:12:41.711
but my delivery was not great.

00:12:41.711 --> 00:12:43.892
And by doing them again, and
again, and again, and again,

00:12:43.892 --> 00:12:45.218
by creating more, and
more, and more, and more,

00:12:45.218 --> 00:12:46.408
you get better.

00:12:46.408 --> 00:12:47.969
You can provide more value,

00:12:47.969 --> 00:12:51.306
and you can have more wealth in 2017.

00:12:51.306 --> 00:12:52.791
So, yes, you need to consume,

00:12:52.791 --> 00:12:55.041
but create, create, create.

00:12:56.647 --> 00:12:57.480
Right now.

00:13:00.812 --> 00:13:02.517
And number seven, the number seven step

00:13:02.517 --> 00:13:06.196
you could take right now
to get wealthy in 2017,

00:13:06.196 --> 00:13:10.071
number seven for me is
to find your one word.

00:13:10.071 --> 00:13:11.150
It's back there.

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:11.983
I wrote a book about it.

00:13:11.983 --> 00:13:13.814
I think self-awareness is
one of the biggest things

00:13:13.814 --> 00:13:14.971
that holds people back.

00:13:14.971 --> 00:13:16.008
Finding your one word

00:13:16.008 --> 00:13:18.923
is about finding the biggest
core value that you have,

00:13:18.923 --> 00:13:21.021
understanding who you are as a human being

00:13:21.021 --> 00:13:24.214
and then bringing that to your
life and to your business.

00:13:24.214 --> 00:13:27.547
For example, if your one word is honesty

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:33.597
then you need to bring more
honesty to your business.

00:13:33.597 --> 00:13:36.180
If you are a real estate
agent, as an example,

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.538
a lot of people don't
like real estate agents.

00:13:37.538 --> 00:13:40.347
A lot of people think real
estate agents aren't very honest.

00:13:40.347 --> 00:13:41.180
Great.

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:44.000
Be the honest real estate
agent, whatever that means.

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:46.309
What does honesty mean to you,

00:13:46.309 --> 00:13:48.487
and bring that to your business

00:13:48.487 --> 00:13:50.290
so you have something that you stand for.

00:13:50.290 --> 00:13:54.088
I would love to work with
the honest real estate agent.

00:13:54.088 --> 00:13:55.409
I think I have a pretty good one,

00:13:55.409 --> 00:13:57.899
but I would love to work with
the honest real estate agent,

00:13:57.899 --> 00:14:02.171
or the honest programmer, or
the honest graphic designer,

00:14:02.171 --> 00:14:03.486
or whatever it is.

00:14:03.486 --> 00:14:06.986
You will attract like-minded people to you

00:14:08.294 --> 00:14:10.463
who will love working with you.

00:14:10.463 --> 00:14:12.651
The guy who doesn't care about honesty

00:14:12.651 --> 00:14:15.154
will be a terrible client for you.

00:14:15.154 --> 00:14:17.723
I don't care about honesty,
just give me the work.

00:14:17.723 --> 00:14:19.203
That's a terrible client.

00:14:19.203 --> 00:14:21.902
He's going to be the most
difficult to come to work with.

00:14:21.902 --> 00:14:22.915
He's going to pay you the least.

00:14:22.915 --> 00:14:24.623
He's never going to refer you clients.

00:14:24.623 --> 00:14:26.641
He's going to give you grief
all through the process

00:14:26.641 --> 00:14:28.411
because your values don't align.

00:14:28.411 --> 00:14:30.005
And so when you figure out your one word

00:14:30.005 --> 00:14:32.334
and then you bring that to your business,

00:14:32.334 --> 00:14:34.184
it allows people to find you

00:14:34.184 --> 00:14:35.733
because now you're standing for something

00:14:35.733 --> 00:14:37.641
that they can self-identify with.

00:14:37.641 --> 00:14:39.063
Where if I look at your website

00:14:39.063 --> 00:14:40.536
it's probably super boring.

00:14:40.536 --> 00:14:42.597
It probably looks like
everybody else in your industry.

00:14:42.597 --> 00:14:44.713
There's no way to tell what you do

00:14:44.713 --> 00:14:46.842
and how you're really that
different than everybody else

00:14:46.842 --> 00:14:48.769
'cause you're all saying the same stuff.

00:14:48.769 --> 00:14:50.185
So why am I going to pick you?

00:14:50.185 --> 00:14:51.544
Maybe because I found your business card

00:14:51.544 --> 00:14:53.734
or something like that, but
why am I going to pick you?

00:14:53.734 --> 00:14:55.585
Give me a reason to pick you.

00:14:55.585 --> 00:14:57.114
Give me a reason to pick you.

00:14:57.114 --> 00:14:58.263
Don't be so boring.

00:14:58.263 --> 00:15:01.071
Inject more of your
personality, your value,

00:15:01.071 --> 00:15:02.798
into your business.

00:15:02.798 --> 00:15:04.674
Where somebody looks at
your website and says

00:15:04.674 --> 00:15:07.334
you are the honest programmer.

00:15:07.334 --> 00:15:08.531
A lot of people will look at that and say

00:15:08.531 --> 00:15:10.446
that's the stupidest thing I've ever seen.

00:15:10.446 --> 00:15:11.344
Amazing.

00:15:11.344 --> 00:15:13.354
You will never work
well with those people.

00:15:13.354 --> 00:15:15.272
Let them self-eliminate.

00:15:15.272 --> 00:15:18.885
Where a lot of people look at
that and say that's awesome.

00:15:18.885 --> 00:15:20.095
Amazing.

00:15:20.095 --> 00:15:21.654
I want to work with that person.

00:15:21.654 --> 00:15:23.595
And now you're not just another programmer

00:15:23.595 --> 00:15:26.671
out of 100 programmers that
are applying for this position

00:15:26.671 --> 00:15:30.836
or being contacted or being
searched for to get that job,

00:15:30.836 --> 00:15:33.485
to win that contract, to get that client.

00:15:33.485 --> 00:15:36.568
You are clearly off in your own world

00:15:37.607 --> 00:15:40.146
and people will self-eliminate
if they don't fit,

00:15:40.146 --> 00:15:42.940
and they'll push towards you if they do,

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.758
and that's exactly what you want.

00:15:44.758 --> 00:15:46.151
So, that's my take.

00:15:46.151 --> 00:15:48.696
That's what I think about
the seven steps you can take

00:15:48.696 --> 00:15:52.010
right now to get wealthy in 2017.

